WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.269
&gt;&gt;&gt; THE CASE OF A MISSING
MASSACHUSETTS WOMAN HAS GOTTEN

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.872
MORE DISTURBING.
PROSECUTORS NOW SAY THAT BLOOD

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:10.510
AND A KNIFE WERE FOUND IN THE
BASEMENT OF ANNA WALSHE'S HOME.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.346
WALSHE WAS LAST SEEN EARLY ON
NEW YEAR'S DAY AND WAS REPORTED

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:16.216
MISSING ON WEDNESDAY.
THIS NEW INFORMATION CAME DURING

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:19.686
A HEARING JUST A SHORT TIME AGO
FOR HER HUSBAND.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:24.491
BRIAN WALSHE IS CHARGED WITH
MISLEADING INVESTIGATORS, AND

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:29.028
CNN HAS MORE ON THE DETAILS.
SO A LOT HAS COME OUT TODAY.

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:30.997
GET US UP TO SPEED ON THE
LATEST.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:33.133
&gt;&gt; Reporter: YEAH, SO THE
ASSISTANT DISTRICT ATTORNEY

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:37.971
THERE IN NORFOLK COUNTY LAYING
OUT THE INSTANCES WHERE THEY SAY

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:41.274
BRIAN WALSHE LIED ABOUT HIS
WHEREABOUTS SURROUNDING THE

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:44.577
DISAPPEARANCE OF HIS WIFE, ANA
WALSHE, AROUND NEW YEAR'S DAY.

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:47.580
NOW IF I COULD BACK UP FOR A
SECOND FOR YOUR VIEWERS AND

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:52.085
EXPLAIN THAT BRIAN WALSHE WAS
ACTUALLY ON PRO-PROBATION

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:56.356
SENTENCING FOR A FRAUD INCIDENT
THAT GOES BACK TO 2020.

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:59.626
HE PLED GUILTY TO.
AS PART OF THAT HE WAS SUPPOSED

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:02.562
TO BE CHECKING IN WITH
AUTHORITIES ON HIS WHEREABOUTS.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.197
SEEMS THAT THAT'S HOW
INVESTIGATORS WERE ABLE TO TELL

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:06.866
THAT HE WAS LYING ABOUT THOSE
WHEREABOUTS.

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.768
AND THERE ARE A NUMBER OF
INSTANCES THAT CAME OUT IN

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:12.305
COURT, BUT ONE THAT STICKS OUT
IS HE TOLD INVESTIGATORS THAT HE

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:16.376
WAS GOING TO TAKE ONE OF HIS
SONS OUT FOR ICE-CREAM AND

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:18.778
INSTEAD IT APPEARS HE WENT TO A
HOME DEPOT.

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:21.547
I WANT YOU TO HEAR FROM THE
ASSISTANT DISTRICT ATTORNEY

00:01:21.547 --> 00:01:26.786
ABOUT WHAT HE WAS DOING THERE.
&gt;&gt; HE'S ON SURVEILLANCE AT THAT

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:30.990
TIME PURCHASING ABOUT $450 WORTH
OF CLEANING SUPPLIES, THAT WOULD

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:39.399
INCLUDE MOPS, BUCKET, TOPS,
TVEX, DROP CLOTHS, AS WELL AS

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:42.168
VARIOUS KINDS OF TAPE.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: AND ACTUALLY WE GOT

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:44.971
THE CRIMINAL COMPLAINT FROM THAT
COURT HEARING, AND IT GOES INTO

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:46.973
MORE DETAIL ABOUT THAT VISIT TO
HOME DEPOT.

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:50.509
IT SAYS THAT HE WAS WEARING A
BLACK SURGICAL MASK, A BLUE

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:53.446
SURGICAL GLOVES, AND MAKING A
CASH PURCHASE.

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:57.617
AS YOU HEARD, $450 WORTH OF
CLEANING SUPPLIES.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:01.754
ALSO MENTIONED A BLOODY KNIFE
FOUND IN THE BASEMENT AS WELL AS

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:03.823
BLOOD STAINS.
HE'S NOT TIED TO THE MURDER YET,

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:06.726
BUT A LOT COMING OUT IN COURT.
HE IS BEING HELD BEHIND BARS AND

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:09.796
WILL BE BACK IN COURT ON THIS
PARTICULAR CHARGE AT LEAST IN

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:11.064
FEBRUARY.
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT.

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:12.765
THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR THAT
UPDATE.

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:16.836
LET'S SPEAK NOW TO FORMER SENIOR
FBI PROFILER AND FORMER FBI

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:21.407
SPECIAL AGENT MARY ELLEN
O'TOOLE.

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:26.145
SO NEW DETAILS WE JUST GOT IN
COURT.

00:02:26.145 --> 00:02:30.250
HE BOUGHT $450 IN CLEANING
SUPPLIES THE DAY AFTER SHE

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.385
DISAPP
DISAPPEARED AND A KNIFE WITH

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:36.522
BLOOD ON IT WAS FOUND.
I WONDER, INNOCENT IT WILL

00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:38.624
PROVEN GUILTY BUT YOU'RE A
PROFILER.

00:02:38.624 --> 00:02:41.527
WHEN YOU LOOK AT THE DETAILS,
WHAT IS YOUR REACTION.

00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:43.696
&gt;&gt; THAT WOULD ELEVATE ANY
INTEREST IN THE HUSBAND AND OF

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:47.767
COURSE ALL OF THAT PHYSICAL
EVIDENCE WOULD HAVE TO BE

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:51.571
ANALYZED TO CONFIRM THAT IT IS
HER BLOOD ON THE KNIFE AND

00:02:51.571 --> 00:02:54.974
CLEANING SUPPLIES ARE OFTEN USED
IN CASES AND PEOPLE THINK THAT

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:59.112
THEY COULD CLEAN UP BLOOD OR
OTHER PHYSICAL EVIDENCE THAT IS

00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:01.748
LEFT BEHIND.
THAT IS NOT TRUE.

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:05.385
SO IF THEY CAN CONFIRM THAT THEY
DO HAVE A SCENE, THEY HAVE A

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:08.955
SCENE WHERE SHE WAS HURT OR
MURDER AND THEY COULD CONFIRM IT

00:03:08.955 --> 00:03:11.991
IS HER, THEN THAT CERTAINLY
ELEVATES THE INTEREST IN HIM.

00:03:11.991 --> 00:03:14.493
&gt;&gt; THERE ARE A LOT OF THINGS
THAT ARE ODD HERE.

00:03:14.493 --> 00:03:17.063
SHE WAS SUPPOSED TO RETURN TO
WORK ON JANUARY 3rd BUT

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:20.333
APPARENTLY THERE WAS A WORK
EMERGENCY AND THAT IS WHY SHE

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:24.136
WAS GOING BACK TO WASHINGTON,
D.C., SUPPOSED TO GO EARLIER.

00:03:24.136 --> 00:03:26.906
AND THERE ARE QUESTIONS ABOUT
WHETHER OR NOT SHE ACTUALLY GOT

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:30.643
IN A RIDE SHARE CAR EARLY MINUTE
MORNING ON THE FIRST TO GO TO

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.278
THE AIRPORT.
AUTHORITIES AREN'T REALLY

00:03:32.278 --> 00:03:35.715
CONFIRMED THAT DETAIL.
DOES THAT STRIKE YOU AS

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:38.051
SURPRISING?
&gt;&gt; IT STRIKES ME AS SURPRISING

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:41.788
BECAUSE THEY SHOULD BE ABLE TO,
IF IT OCCURRED, THEY SHOULD BE

00:03:41.788 --> 00:03:45.625
ABLE TO CONFIRM THE UBER OR THE
TAXI OR SOME OTHER RIDE SHARE

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:48.928
THAT PICKED HER UP.
SO THEY PROBABLY HAVE THAT

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:50.930
INFORMATION.
BUT THEY'RE NOT RELEASING IT.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.466
BECAUSE THAT WOULD BE EASY TO
CONFIRM.

00:03:53.466 --> 00:03:59.105
&gt;&gt; TELL US ABOUT NEXT STEPS IN
AN INVESTIGATION LIKE THIS?

00:03:59.105 --> 00:04:03.443
WHAT WILL THEY DO WITH REGARDS
TO BOTH THE HUSBAND HERE, BUT

00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:07.046
ALSO IN TERMS OF INVESTIGATING
THE DISAPPEARANCE ITSELF.

00:04:07.046 --> 00:04:13.452
&gt;&gt; WELL ONE OF THE PRIORITIES IS
OBVIOUSLY TO TRY TO FIND -- IF

00:04:13.452 --> 00:04:16.055
SHE'S DEAD TO TRY TO FIND HER
BODY AND THEY HAVE BEEN DOING

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:19.592
THAT.
BUT IT IS A PRETTY DIFFICULT

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:23.563
SITUATION TO JUST HAVE SEARCHERS
OUT THERE WITH DOGS TRYING TO

00:04:23.563 --> 00:04:28.301
LOOK IN A LOCATION WHERE A HUMAN
BODY MAY OR MAY NOT BE.

00:04:28.301 --> 00:04:31.371
SO, PROBABLY AT THIS POINT, WHAT
THEY'RE DOING, IF HE'S NOT

00:04:31.371 --> 00:04:34.273
TALKING TO THEM, IS THEY'RE
TALKING TO OTHER PEOPLE THAT ARE

00:04:34.273 --> 00:04:37.910
CLOSE TO THE FAMILY, OTHER
PEOPLE THAT MAY HAVE OTHER

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:43.282
INFORMATION AND, OF COURSE, IF
THE HUSBAND HAS TRANSPORTED HER

00:04:43.282 --> 00:04:46.419
SOMEPLACE, THEY'LL BE SEARCHING
THE CAR FOR ALL SORTS OF

00:04:46.419 --> 00:04:48.821
PHYSICAL EVIDENCE.
&gt;&gt; STILL SO MANY QUESTIONS AT

00:04:48.821 --> 00:04:50.823
THIS POINT.
MARY ELLEN O'TOOLE, APPRECIATE

00:04:50.823 --> 00:04:52.024
YOUR INSIGHT.
THANK YOU.

